   "q": "In a programming contest, a student is given a postfix expression generated by a compiler optimization module. The expression is: 10 5 2 * + 8 4 / 6 3 - * - 7 + As part of debugging, the student needs to evaluate the postfix expression manually using a stack. Write a pseudocode to evaluate any postfix expression using a stack. Then, using the pseudocode, evaluate the above postfix expression step-by-step. Show the content of the stack after each step and finally give the result.",
